Hi,

2 weeks ago, I sent this list a mail about a change I made to implement
some parallel I/O.

Since Jeff Dike's "uml: batch I/O requests" change had in its
description "Send as many I/O requests to the I/O thread as possible,
even though it will still only handle one at a time.", I thought that
being able to process several requests in parallel was a wanted feature.

But I have had no feedback at all, and as far as I can see, no message
has been sent to the list since 2008/09/12 (except my second message on
2008/09/15).

So is this list dead? Are the main maintainers all busy with real life?


Cheers,

Nicolas Boullis

